1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,860
Setting up voice takes about two minutes. Here's how.

2
00:00:05,059 --> 00:00:09,019
First, put the app on your home screen. On iPad, tap Share,

3
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:12,910
then Add to Home Screen. On Android, just tap the Add button.

4
00:00:14,109 --> 00:00:18,750
Next, connect your earbuds in Bluetooth settings, then come back to the app.

5
00:00:19,949 --> 00:00:23,550
Tap Turn on microphone, and allow it. Say a few words.

6
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:26,129
The green bar shows the app can hear you.

7
00:00:27,329 --> 00:00:31,660
Tap Play. If you hear the message in your earbuds, tap yes.

8
00:00:32,859 --> 00:00:36,890
Press your earbud button once. If your earbuds don't support it,

9
00:00:36,689 --> 00:00:39,460
you'll get a big green Talk button instead.

10
00:00:40,659 --> 00:00:46,060
Finally, practice by saying: smoke alarm missing. Nothing gets recorded.

11
00:00:47,259 --> 00:00:50,900
That's it. Press once to talk, twice for the next item,

12
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:53,020
and say undo if anything is wrong.
